  <!-- EN: greathelm -->
  <TA_Greathelm.label>大头盔</TA_Greathelm.label>
  <!-- EN: Large, thick, fully enclosed helmet. While rather cumbersome and significantly restricts wearer's field of view and breathing, it provides great protection for a heavily armored rider. -->
  <TA_Greathelm.description>大型、厚重、全封闭式头盔。虽然相当笨重且会显著限制佩戴者的视野和呼吸，但能为重装骑士提供极佳的防护。</TA_Greathelm.description>
  
